<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vistana started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vistana started with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Michael Rietbrock confirmed he initiated coverage of Vistana Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target $17.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings $0.70 a share, compared with $0.44 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings $0.90 a share.</p>
</text>
